            "paragraph": "I become Spa Director at Murrieta Hot Springs, one of Southern California's first wellness spas. Unable to find clean skincare that meets my standards, I start creating my own formulas. The following year, I formulated what would eventually become the first OSEA product: Essential Hydrating Oil."
